+// The level an encoder wrote into the first SPS of the Annex B stream |data|, in C2 terms, or
+// LEVEL_UNUSED when the stream has no SPS or the level is not one C2 knows. A device may choose a
+// level of its own, so the level of the stream is what the component has to report.
+C2Config::level_t extractStreamLevel(bool isHEVC, const uint8_t* data, size_t length);
